    "title": "Minimum Cost Tree From Leaf Values",
    "category": "Dynamic Programming",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "problemStatement": "Given the inorder traversal of the leaf nodes of a binary tree, construct a binary tree such that every non-leaf node equals the product of the largest leaf values in its left and right subtrees. Determine the minimum possible sum of all non-leaf nodes.",
